    "identifier": "breath-of-earth-smash",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect earth release chakra until it laces the striking portion of your weapon, magnifying its weight. You fool your opponent(s) into thinking you are striking and suddenly shift your attack into another angle.</p>\n<p>All creatures of your choice must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they take your weapons damage + 1d8 earth damage on a failed save, or half as much on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: All creatures within range who have ranks of any Mental condition, suffers a -2 penalty to their saving throw.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, you can change the saving throw to a Strength save.</p>",
